\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks for the direction and size of price changes in 2027.\"}\n{\"n\":21,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much contract prices change over 2027.\"}\n{\"n\":22,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome asks for the direction and magnitude of 2026 price changes.\"}\n{\"n\":23,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks for the contract price change in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":24,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much DRAM contract prices rise in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":25,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much server-memory contract prices rise in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":26,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks for the 2026 contract-price change.\"}\n{\"n\":27,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks for the change in DDR5 contract prices over 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":28,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much contract memory prices rise in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":29,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome compares 2026 contract memory prices with the prior year.\"}\n{\"n\":30,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It tracks prices and per-rack memory cost across the two-year period against the reported starting cost.\"}\n{\"n\":31,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It measures 2027 memory cost and price direction against the reported 2026 cost.\"}\n{\"n\":32,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome compares 2026 contract prices with 2025.\"}\n{\"n\":33,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much DDR5 contract prices rise in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":34,\"mark\":\"one-year price\",\"why\":\"It asks for average contract price levels in 2027 and the resulting per-rack cost.\"}\n{\"n\":35,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much contract memory prices rise over 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":36,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome tracks both the level and direction of contract prices in 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":37,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks how much contract prices rise across 2026 and 2027.\"}\n{\"n\":38,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It asks whether memory price inflation continues or eases during 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":39,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It checks 2027 average prices against 2026 levels.\"}\n{\"n\":40,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It compares average contract prices in 2027 with 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":41,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome tracks price direction and whether the cost surge continues or reverses.\"}\n{\"n\":42,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"Its outcome compares 2027 contract price levels with 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":43,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It measures 2027 prices against the higher contract prices reported for 2026.\"}\n{\"n\":44,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It compares 2026 contract memory prices with the prior year.\"}\n{\"n\":45,\"mark\":\"change\",\"why\":\"It compares 2026 contract prices with prior levels and asks whether they rise or ease.\"}"}}
